{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player action game playable in both first-person and third-person perspectives. Players can choose to pilot a combat mech armed with guns and blades, slashing through disgusting cockroaches in post-apocalyptic ruins to eliminate regional threats. Alternatively, players may take control of a cockroach and outsmart AI-controlled mechs.Humanity built war mechs against beasts ravaging civilization. None recall if nature's wrath or man's folly sparked the frenzy. Now they whisper lies to the tides, begging forgiveness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808980?t=1752581789","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808980/b64418b08594acdde12789844bb94179ef391e4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752581789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808980/c1c804eba41c828c4929a1289c293e62a691adb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752581789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808980/c1c804eba41c828c4929a1289c293e62a691adb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752581789","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3869790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player action game playable in both first-person and third-person perspectives. Players can choose to pilot a combat mech armed with guns and blades, slashing through disgusting cockroaches in post-apocalyptic ruins to eliminate regional threats. Alternatively, players may take control of a cockroach and outsmart AI